Maintainer: peterzen <peter@froggle.org>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: froggle-qubes-keepassxc-wrapper
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: qubes-core-agent-qrexec
Description: KeePassXC-Browser over Qubes qrexec
 Lets the KeePassXC-Browser extension in a Qubes qube talk to KeePassXC in
 another qube (the vault) via the custom.KeePassXC qrexec service. Installs
 the keepassxc-proxy-qrexec wrapper and system-wide native messaging
 manifests (org.keepassxc.keepassxc_browser) for Firefox, Chromium, Brave and
 Google Chrome. Install it in the browser qube's template.
 .
 The vault qube's name is set in /etc/default/keepassxc-proxy-qrexec. The
 vault side (qrexec service running keepassxc-proxy) and the dom0 policy for
 custom.KeePassXC are not part of this package.
